{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03857","headline":"同徐员外除太子舍人寓直之作 · 郭震","name":"同徐员外除太子舍人寓直之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太子擅元良，宫臣命伟长。\n除荣辞会府，直宿总书坊。\n露湿幽岩桂，风吹便坐桑。\n阁连云一色，池带月重光。\n叶死兰无气，荷枯水不香。\n遥闻秋兴作，言是晋中郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭震","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}